<h1 class="font-headline-lg-mobile text-headline-lg-mobile md:font-headline-lg md:text-headline-lg text-on-surface">Our Collections</h1>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl mt-4">Explore our curated gallery of hand-crafted Athangudi patterns, where traditional Chettinad artistry meets contemporary architectural precision.</p>
