<img class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-alt="A high-fidelity close-up of a Lotus pattern Athangudi tile featuring intricate symmetrical petals in deep heritage crimson and soft cream colors. The lighting is soft and architectural, highlighting the slight tactile variations in the cement texture. The aesthetic is clean, professional, and minimalist, emphasizing the artisanal craftsmanship of the tile." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAq4BXuY-eVE0CqaKNPn3dsZkjimuOp6nw3j6uTPI8xCtM19H5E3YCbQz0epJmvot7oEb1nhLv7NKRckKs6jMETO079BRAugF6E2YfBbC4X4ZKEPj1DGameJyyNGwtwLOb9MNbu9bDw9p6YaGkd4TUqTh--xFVAKadlSPmBrjq6jBZvHIWE4UpVa3m0jzzXab1cQ26VlRXLldEJwX_ye8Xuz41RuVk3K17GkF1LmfAUtAoGbdPNmypXa6B2KMxgnEYuo2Ro2IZCVMs"/>
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/20 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
