<img class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-alt="A detailed overhead shot of the Flower Star Athangudi tile pattern. The design features a geometric star-shaped flower with architectural blue and terracotta-warmth accents on a neutral cream base. The surface has a subtle, sophisticated sheen reflecting soft studio lighting. Minimalist composition with high-contrast sharp edges typical of premium manufacturing." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBPFEKR3MSU7Bww7K2uNBjTmdf7ci9Ehx9mcHbaKaPIhUcoqv0o1hT_QfkRd1ApmNbFVNAN8sqiVzwJFl_RpwgAQD76ow-weaZc4_xOKo9os8ve4HeHh9d9ifDif7fOQ0Qvu_NBXP7HSX82kKIL7QQ4027B25XoAZ9vor1rURZP4gNwY48kMLLu0WEyDIs1RjW2lkkGCcnf9VVK0FRkXiySbDGIL865c-M7Jrfbn8j1QJTSBbPKklEmfZ1DyGsLD8rNZPRuOMFKy8o"/>
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/20 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
<div class="flex justify-between items-start">
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-on-surface">Flower Star</h3>
