<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/20 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
<div class="flex justify-between items-start">
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-on-surface">Butterfly Suite</h3>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant py-1 px-3 bg-surface-container rounded-full">CONTEMPORARY</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-2">Delicate wing-like patterns that dance across the floor, offering a light and airy ambiance to modern residential spaces.</p>
<div class="flex gap-4 mt-4">
<button class="bg-heritage-crimson text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-lg font-label-sm text-label-sm hover:bg-primary transition-all active:scale-95">VIEW DETAILS</button>
<button class="border border-architectural-blue text-architectural-blue px-6 py-2 rounded-lg font-label-sm text-label-sm hover:bg-architectural-blue/5 transition-all">VISUALIZE</button>
